  "label": "User is projected onto the welcoming family scene",
  "description": "The user is projected onto the scene of the family and dog in a sunny outdoor setting, as this scene is used to embody the welcoming message for Melbourne. The user is invited to imagine themselves as a visitor being welcomed into this warm, friendly environment. There are no explicit deictic pronouns like 'you' or 'me' in the text, but the overall intent of the meme creates an implicit projection where the viewer is the recipient of the welcome.",
